# Quick Test Reference

## Run Tests Locally (Without Modifying CI)

### One-Time Setup
```bash
pip install -e .[tests]
```

### Run All Tests
```bash
pytest tests
```

### Run Specific Test File
```bash
pytest tests/test_ecc_verification.py -v
```

### Run Specific Test Function
```bash
pytest tests/test_ecc_verification.py::test_ec_verify_x962_signature -v
```

### Run Tests in a Directory
```bash
pytest tests/pki/ -v
```

### Common Options
```bash
pytest tests -v           # Verbose output
pytest tests -vv          # Very verbose output
pytest tests -s           # Show print statements
pytest tests -x           # Stop on first failure
pytest tests --maxfail=3  # Stop after 3 failures
```

### CI Replication
```bash
# Replicate exactly what CI does:
python -m pip install --upgrade pip
python -m pip install -r requirements-dev.txt
pytest tests
```

For more details, see [TESTING.md](TESTING.md).
